<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30264" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκεράννῡμι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκεντ-ύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mix</i>, esp. wine, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνόν τ᾽ ἐγκεράσασα πιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.189
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρεῖς μόνους κρατῆρας ἐγκεραννύω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					94.1
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκίρνημι</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἐ. τι εἰς ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					427c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>mix for oneself</i>: metaph., <i>concoct</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρήγματα μεγάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.124
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκεράσασθαι παιδιάν</span>
			<i>mix in</i> a little amusement, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				268d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be multiplied together</i>, of numbers, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				45
			</span></i>.</div>
